      en: ["The Port of El Guamache was opened for international operations in 1975.", "The cruise ship pier can accommodate vessels up to 300 meters (984 feet) in length.", "It is located approximately 15 kilometers (9 miles) south of Punta de Piedras.", "El Guamache is the only deep-water port facility on Margarita Island.", "The port is managed by Bolipuertos, the national port authority of Venezuela.", "It serves as the primary entry point for goods under the island's Duty-Free status."],
