      hu: ["Amuay megnyitásakor a világ egyik legmodernebb finomító-kikötője volt.", "A kikötő mólói akár 100 000 tonnás tartályhajókat is képesek fogadni.", "Az amuayi finomító napi kapacitása meghaladja a 600 000 hordót.", "A kikötő mellett található Judibana városa, amelyet a finomító dolgozóinak építettek.", "Az amuayi export jelentős része az amerikai és a kínai piacokra irányul.", "A kikötő infrastruktúrája közvetlen összeköttetésben áll a közeli Cardón finomítóval."],
      ro: ["Portul Amuay a fost inaugurat pentru operațiuni comerciale în anul 1950.", "Danele sale pot găzdui nave cu un pescaj de până la 13 metri.", "Capacitatea de procesare a rafinăriei adiacente este de 645.000 de barili pe zi.", "Portul este conectat prin conducte submarine cu alte terminale din regiune.", "Amuay este punctul central pentru distribuția internă de combustibil în Venezuela.", "Complexul CRP, din care face parte, este al doilea ca mărime din lume."],
      en: ["Amuay was one of the world's most advanced refinery-port complexes when it opened.", "The port berths are capable of handling tankers up to 100,000 deadweight tons.", "The Amuay refinery has a processing capacity of approximately 645,000 barrels per day.", "The port is adjacent to the town of Judibana, a planned community for oil workers.", "Significant volumes of exports from Amuay are destined for North American and Asian markets.", "The CRP complex, including Amuay, is the second-largest refinery system in the world."],
